[0.020223,"o","No existing configuration found — running first-time setup.\r\nConfiguration Location\r\nConfig file:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-p_rvxhor/config.yaml\r\nSecrets file: /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-p_rvxhor/.env\r\nData folder:  /tmp/hermes-ui-rust-p_rvxhor\r\nInstall dir:  /home/runner/work/hermes-rust-version/hermes-rust-version/crates/hermes-cli\r\nYou can edit these files directly or use 'hermes config edit'\r\n\r\nTip: jump straight to a section with 'hermes setup model|terminal|gateway|tools|agent', or fill only missing items with --quick.\r\nPress Enter to keep it, or type a new value to change it.\r\n\r\n\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;10m?\u001b[39m How would you like to set up Hermes?  \r\n\u001b[38;5;14m>\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;14mQuick Setup (Nous Portal) — free OAuth login, no API keys, model + tools (recommended)\u001b[39m\r\n  Full setup — configure every provider, tool & option yourself (bring your own keys)\r\n  Blank Slate — everything off except the bare minimum; opt in to each capability\r\n\u001b[38;5;14m[\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m↑↓ to move, enter to select, type to filter\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;14m]\u001b[39m\r\u001b[4A\u001b[39C\u001b[?25h"]
